---
layout: base.njk
title: "Thank You"
description: "Thanks for reaching out to TechFun Universe — we'll be in touch soon."
---
<section class="hero" style="padding-bottom: var(--space-6); min-height:50vh; display:flex; align-items:center;">
  <svg class="hero-arc" viewBox="0 0 400 400" fill="none">
    <path d="M120 20 C 260 40, 380 140, 360 260 C 345 350, 250 380, 170 360" stroke="#FF7A00" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.85"/>
    <circle cx="170" cy="360" r="7" fill="#FF7A00"/>
  </svg>
  <div class="container hero-inner text-center reveal" style="max-width:560px; margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="eyebrow" style="justify-content:center;">Message Sent</span>
    <h1 style="color:#fff;">Thanks — we've got your request</h1>
    <p class="lead" style="margin:0 auto;">We usually reply within one business day. If it's urgent, message us directly on WhatsApp and we'll get back to you sooner.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta" style="justify-content:center;">
      <a href="https://wa.me/{{ contact.whatsapp | replace(' ', '') | replace('+', '') }}" class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Message on WhatsApp</a>
      <a href="/" class="btn btn-ghost">Back to Home</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
